:''Money for defeating enemies increased!''
The '''Super Register''' is the sixth [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. It increases the amount of money dropped by enemies during [[Battle|battle]].

==Effect==
Each Super Register increases the money obtained from defeated enemies by a maximum +50%.

When a player has activated Super Register at 100% in all three chapters, the money obtained from defeating enemies is increased by +150%.

