==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, the Super Register's equivalent is the '''Greediness of Tōkai''' (東海のがめつさ), Tōkai being a partial region of Chūbu south of Japan.
**In the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]], it was shortened to just '''Greediness'''.
